{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JON","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"约拿书","commonName":"约拿书","title":"约拿书","order":32,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"0008d19fae71ee096b7c0300b3bb08f70bf68552f98a4321777a48f4ce2ae5b3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JON/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JON/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":48},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["约拿的忿怒和 神的怜悯"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["这事约拿大大不悦，且甚发怒，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["就祷告耶和华说：「耶和华啊，我在本国的时候岂不是这样说吗？我知道你是有恩典、有怜悯的 神，不轻易发怒，有丰盛的慈爱，并且后悔不降所说的灾，所以我急速逃往他施去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和华啊，现在求你取我的命吧！因为我死了比活着还好。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和华说：「你这样发怒合乎理吗？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["于是约拿出城，坐在城的东边，在那里为自己搭了一座棚，坐在棚的荫下，要看看那城究竟如何。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和华 神安排一棵蓖麻，使其发生高过约拿，影儿遮盖他的头，救他脱离苦楚；约拿因这棵蓖麻大大喜乐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["次日黎明， 神却安排一条虫子咬这蓖麻，以致枯槁。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["日头出来的时候， 神安排炎热的东风，日头曝晒约拿的头，使他发昏，他就为自己求死，说：「我死了比活着还好！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["神对约拿说：「你因这棵蓖麻发怒合乎理吗？」他说：「我发怒以至于死，都合乎理！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶和华说：「这蓖麻不是你栽种的，也不是你培养的；一夜发生，一夜干死，你尚且爱惜；"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["何况这尼尼微大城，其中不能分辨左手右手的有十二万多人，并有许多牲畜，我岂能不爱惜呢？」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JON/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MIC/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JON/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}